1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,690
Welcome to the technical demonstration of SafeZone,

2
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:08,130
Sri Lanka's disaster early-warning network, built by The Pioneers.

3
00:00:09,430 --> 00:00:12,490
SafeZone is a Flutter app, backed by Supabase.

4
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:17,880
PostGIS stores zones, shelters and incidents as geospatial data.

5
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:23,370
Auth separates citizens from authorities, Realtime streams changes to every device,

6
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:26,330
and Storage holds incident photos and video.

7
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:34,850
When an authority broadcasts a geo-targeted alert, Supabase Realtime delivers it to every device in the zone.

8
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:38,750
Alerts are banded: advisory, watch, warning, and critical.

9
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:44,230
Critical alerts use a dedicated alarm channel that bypasses Do Not Disturb,

10
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:47,440
with SMS and in-app fallback if push fails.

11
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:54,770
Citizens report incidents with photos or video, and flag life-threatening ones as SOS.

12
00:00:54,970 --> 00:00:59,750
Neighbours confirm each report, and a credibility score updates automatically,

13
00:00:59,950 --> 00:01:02,070
so authorities can trust what they see.

14
00:01:03,370 --> 00:01:06,110
Connectivity is never guaranteed in a flood.

15
00:01:06,310 --> 00:01:11,930
SafeZone caches up to two thousand map tiles, and prefetches the area around every route.

16
00:01:12,130 --> 00:01:17,840
Alerts and recent activity stay on the device, so core safety information works offline.

17
00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:22,460
Beyond alerts, SafeZone coordinates the response.

18
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:27,790
Shelters publish live capacity and supplies. Volunteers sign up for tasks.

19
00:01:27,990 --> 00:01:34,870
Citizens message shelter managers, and the Safety Circle shares I'm Safe check-ins and live arrival times.

20
00:01:36,170 --> 00:01:40,880
Authorities get a broadcast dashboard with reach tracking and a full audit log.

21
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:48,590
The interface supports English, Sinhala and Tamil, scalable text, high contrast, and captions for siren alerts.

22
00:01:49,890 --> 00:01:54,170
SafeZone: real-time, offline-resilient, and built to be trusted.

23
00:01:54,370 --> 00:01:55,900
Thank you, from The Pioneers.

